根据这个计划，

06:19.344 --> 06:21.689
AFTER THE SHELLY SUPERHIGHWAY
GOES THROUGH JELLYFISH FIELDS,
经过谢利高速公路之后
穿过水母田，

06:21.758 --> 06:23.310
