- WHAT? YOU'VE BEEN WHAT?
- 不是那样。
- 什么？你曾经是什么？

07:25.724 --> 07:27.965
- WE'RE TALKING ABOUT
THAT NEW SUPERHIGHWAY
- 我们正在谈论
那条新的高速公路

07:28.034 --> 07:29.551
YOU'RE PLANNING ON BUILDING.
您正在计划建造。

07:29.620 --> 07:31.172
AND IN CASE YOU DIDN'T KNOW,
如果你不知道，

07:31.241 --> 07:33.275
IT'S GONNA DESTROY
JELLYFISH FIELDS.
它会毁灭
水母区。

07:33.344 --> 07:35.827
NOT TO MENTION THAT YOUR PLAN
IS STUPID AND DUMB
更不用说你的计划
又蠢又笨

07:35.896 --> 07:37.482
AND DUMB AND STUPID.
又蠢又蠢。

07:37.551 --> 07:39.448
- WAIT A MINUTE.
YOU'VE BEEN WHAT?
- 等一下。
你曾经是什么？

07:39.517 --> 07:41.862
- WELL, THAT CERTAINLY WAS
AN INTERESTING SERIES OF WORDS
- 嗯，那确实是
一系列有趣的单词

07:41.931 --> 07:44.241
THAT JUST TUMBLED OUT
PAST YOUR TEETH AND LIPS,
刚刚跌落的
经过你的牙齿和嘴唇，

07:44.310 --> 07:47.586
BUT FRANKLY, MY DEAR SPONGE,
I DON'T GIVE A BARNACLE.
但坦白说，我亲爱的海绵，
我不给藤壶。

07:47.655 --> 07:48.793
- HUH?
- 嗯？

07:48.862 --> 07:50.931
- I DON'T KNOW.
- 我不知道。

07:51.000 --> 07:52.103
- FORGET IT.
- 忘了它。

07:52.172 --> 07:53.827
EVEN IF I WANTED TO STOP
即使我想停下来

07:53.896 --> 07:55.344
THE SHELLY SUPERHIGHWAY
FROM BEING BUILT,
谢利高速公路
从建成之日起，

07:55.413 --> 07:57.000
IT WOULD BE IMPOSSIBLE.
这是不可能的。

07:57.068 --> 07:58.655
- WHY?
- 为什么？

07:58.724 --> 08:00.689
- BECAUSE THE WHOLE CITY
HAS ALREADY APPROVED IT.
- 因为整个城市
已经批准了。

08:00.758 --> 08:02.655
SEE FOR YOURSELF
亲自看看

08:02.724 --> 08:06.793
THROUGH THIS
CONVENIENTLY TIMED FLASHBACK.
通过这个
方便的定时闪回。

08:06.862 --> 08:08.482
[crowd murmuring]
[人群窃窃私语]

08:08.551 --> 08:10.275
- ORDER. ORDER.
[gavel pounding]
- 命令。命令。
[木槌敲击]

08:10.344 --> 08:13.000
ORDER IN THE MEETING HALL.
[clunking]
会议厅内的秩序。
[叮当声]

08:13.068 --> 08:16.689
NOW, ALL THOSE IN FAVOR
OF PAVING OVER JELLYFISH FIELDS
现在，所有赞成者
水母区的铺路

08:16.758 --> 08:19.068
AND BUILDING
THE SHELLY SUPERHIGHWAY,
和建筑
谢利高速公路，

08:19.137 --> 08:21.275
RAISE YOUR RIGHT FIN AND SAY,
"AYE."
举起你的右鳍并说：
“是啊。”

08:21.344 --> 08:22.965
all: AYE.
所有人：是的。

08:23.034 --> 08:24.931
- EVERYBODY ELSE JUST SIT THERE,
QUIETLY.
- 其他人就坐在那里，
安静地。

08:25.000 --> 08:26.586
- I LIKE HIGHWAYS.
- 我喜欢高速公路。

08:26.655 --> 08:27.965
- I LIKE THINGS
THAT ARE SUPER.
- 我喜欢的东西
太棒了。

08:28.034 --> 08:30.310
- AND I LIKE SAYING, "AYE."
- 我喜欢说，“是的。”

08:30.379 --> 08:34.310
OH, WHY DID I SAY, "AYE"?
哦，我为什么说“是”？

08:34.379 --> 08:36.413
- SEEMS AS THOUGH
THE AYES HAVE IT.
- 看起来好像
同意的人拥有它。

08:36.482 --> 08:37.965
NOW, IF YOU'LL EXCUSE ME,
现在，请原谅我，

08:38.034 --> 08:39.655
I'VE GOT
SUPERHIGHWAY PREPARATIONS
我有
高速公路准备工作

08:39.724 --> 08:41.137
TO BE ATTENDING TO.
正在参加。

08:41.206 --> 08:43.379
TOODLES.
工具。

08:43.448 --> 08:45.413
- WHAT ARE WE GONNA DO NOW,
MR. KRABS?
- 我们现在要做什么，
先生。螃蟹？

08:45.482 --> 08:48.137
- WELL, I'M GONNA DO
THE ONLY THING I CAN DO
- 好吧，我会做
我唯一能做的

08:48.206 --> 08:51.379
WHEN ME CHARACTER IS TESTED
BY INSURMOUNTABLE ODDS:
当我的性格受到考验时
难以克服的赔率：

08:51.448 --> 08:54.413
LIE ON ME BACK
AND SOB LOUDLY.
躺在我背上
大声抽泣。

08:54.482 --> 08:56.206
- NORMALLY, MR. KRABS,
- 通常情况下，先生。螃蟹，

08:56.275 --> 08:57.896
I WOULD LIE ON MY BACK
AND SOB LOUDLY TOO,
我会仰卧
也大声抽泣，

08:57.965 --> 08:59.655
BUT I AM NOT GIVING UP.
但我不会放弃。

08:59.724 --> 09:01.965
THERE'S STILL ONE CITIZEN
IN BIKINI BOTTOM
还有一名公民
比基尼下装

09:02.034 --> 09:03.758
WHO WON'T SIT STILL
谁不会坐以待毙

09:03.827 --> 09:05.724
IN THE FACE
OF THIS OUTRAGEOUS INJUSTICE.
当面
这种令人发指的不公正行为。

09:11.655 --> 09:15.103
