[crowd booing]
[人群嘘声]

10:58.620 --> 11:00.068
- IT'S WORKING, PATRICK.
- 成功了，帕特里克。

11:00.137 --> 11:01.724
THEY'RE BOOING THE HIGHWAY.
他们在高速公路上发出嘘声。

11:01.793 --> 11:03.551
LOOKS LIKE OUR MESSAGE
看起来像我们的信息

11:03.620 --> 11:05.551
HAS REALLY STARTED
GETTING THROUGH TO THE PEOPLE.
已经真正开始了
深入人心。

11:05.620 --> 11:08.172
LET'S PLAY ANOTHER SONG
WHILE THEIR HEARTS ARE OPEN.
让我们再演奏一首歌曲
当他们的心敞开时。

11:08.241 --> 11:10.655
HEY, WAIT A MINUTE.
嘿，等一下。

11:10.724 --> 11:12.482
THIS IS ONE OF OUR FLYERS.
这是我们的一张传单。

11:12.551 --> 11:14.172
THEY'RE PELTING US
WITH OUR OWN PAMPHLETS.
他们向我们投掷
附有我们自己的小册子。

11:14.241 --> 11:15.655
WHAT DOES THIS MEAN?
这意味着什么？

11:15.724 --> 11:19.034
- I COULDN'T TELL YOU.
- 我无法告诉你。

11:19.103 --> 11:22.172
- I'LL TELL YOU WHAT IT MEANS.
- 我会告诉你这意味着什么。

11:22.241 --> 11:23.655
IT MEANS THIS.
这就是这个意思。

11:23.724 --> 11:25.482
[tambourine jangling]
[手鼓叮当作响]

11:25.551 --> 11:27.551
- IT MEANS YOU HATE TAMBOURINES?
- 这意味着你讨厌铃鼓？

11:27.620 --> 11:30.551
- NO, IT MEANS--
[siren wails]
- 不，这意味着——
[警报声]

11:30.620 --> 11:33.551
- ALL RIGHT,
YOU GUYS THE HIGHWAY HATERS?
- 好吧，
你们是讨厌高速公路的人吗？

11:33.620 --> 11:35.137
- YES, BUT WITH GOOD REASON,
SIR.
- 是的，但有充分的理由，
先生。

11:35.206 --> 11:36.931
YOU SEE,
WITHOUT JELLYFISH FIELDS,
你看，
没有水母场，

11:37.000 --> 11:38.758
JELLYFISH WILL HAVE TO FIND
A NEW HOME AND--
水母必须找到
一个新家和——

11:38.827 --> 11:40.448
- ALL RIGHT, YOU TWO,
YOU'RE UNDER ARREST.
- 好吧，你们两个，
你被捕了。

11:40.517 --> 11:41.758
- WHAT FOR?
- 做什么的？

11:41.827 --> 11:43.413
- UNLICENSED USE OF A SITAR.
- 未经许可使用西塔琴。

11:43.482 --> 11:45.137
- BUT MY GRANDMA
GAVE ME THIS SITAR.
- 但是我的奶奶
给了我这把西塔琴。

11:45.206 --> 11:46.655
IT DIDN'T COME WITH A LICENSE.
它没有许可证。

11:46.724 --> 11:48.448
- YEAH, WELL,
NEITHER DID THIS.
- 是啊，好吧，
这也没有。

11:48.517 --> 11:50.689
all: HIGHWAY! HIGHWAY!
所有人：高速公路！公路！

11:50.758 --> 11:53.000
HIGHWAY! HIGHWAY!
公路！公路！

11:53.068 --> 11:55.275
HIGHWAY! HIGHWAY!
公路！公路！

11:55.344 --> 11:56.689
HIGHWAY! HIGHWAY!
公路！公路！

11:56.758 --> 11:58.655
[doors slam]
[关上门]

11:58.724 --> 12:00.000
[all cheering]
[大家欢呼]

12:00.068 --> 12:01.827
[flashbulbs popping]
[闪光灯爆响]

12:01.896 --> 12:03.482
[cheering continues]
[欢呼声继续]

12:08.206 --> 12:10.310
- PATRICK, I'M SCARED.
- 帕特里克，我很害怕。

12:10.379 --> 12:14.586
- SPONGEBOB, I'LL NEVER FORGET
WHAT MY GREAT-UNCLE CLETUS SAID
- 海绵宝宝，我永远不会忘记
我的叔祖父克莱图斯说的话

12:14.655 --> 12:17.137
RIGHT BEFORE HE WAS ARRESTED
DURING A FREEDOM MARCH.
就在他被捕之前
在自由游行期间。

12:17.206 --> 12:19.310
- WHAT WAS THAT?
- 那是什么？

12:19.379 --> 12:21.862
- IT'S WHERE A BUNCH OF PEOPLE
GO WALKING DOWN THE STREET AND--
- 这是一群人的地方
沿着街道走，然后——

12:21.931 --> 12:23.482
- I KNOW WHAT
A FREEDOM MARCH IS, PATRICK.
- 我知道什么
自由游行是，帕特里克。

12:23.551 --> 12:24.517
I MEAN, WHAT DID HE SAY?
我的意思是，他说什么？

12:24.586 --> 12:26.482
- OH, YEAH.
- 哦，是的。

12:26.551 --> 12:30.172
HE SAID, "LET NOT YOUR HEART
WALK AWAY FROM YOU
他说：“不要让你的心
远离你

12:30.241 --> 12:33.103
LEST YOUR MIND GROW LEGS
AND FOLLOW IT."
以免你的头脑长出腿来
并遵循它。”

12:33.172 --> 12:36.896
- WOW, YOUR UNCLE SOUNDS LIKE
A PRETTY SMART GUY, PATRICK.
- 哇，你叔叔听起来像
帕特里克，一个非常聪明的人。

12:36.965 --> 12:38.379
WHAT HAPPENED TO HIM
AFTER HE WAS ARRESTED?
他发生了什么事
他被捕后？

12:38.448 --> 12:39.724
- I DON'T KNOW.
- 我不知道。

12:39.793 --> 12:42.034
HE WAS NEVER HEARD FROM AGAIN.
从此再也没有他的消息。

12:48.172 --> 12:49.620
[both yelp]
[两人都尖叫]

12:49.689 --> 12:51.344
[tires squealing]
[轮胎吱吱声]

12:51.413 --> 12:53.793
- SEE YOU LATER, LONGHAIRS.
- 再见，长毛们。

12:53.862 --> 12:55.344
- BYE.
- BYE!
- 再见。
- 再见！

12:55.413 --> 12:56.517
- IT'S A WIG.
- SEE YOU LATER.
- 这是假发。
- 稍后见。

12:56.586 --> 12:58.172
THANKS FOR THE LIFT.
感谢您乘坐电梯。

12:58.241 --> 12:59.965
THEY LEFT US
IN THE MIDDLE OF NOWHERE.
他们离开了我们
在偏僻的地方。

13:00.034 --> 13:01.896
- WELL, THIS ISN'T
THE MIDDLE OF NOWHERE.
- 嗯，这不是
偏僻的地方。

13:01.965 --> 13:03.448
WE'RE ACTUALLY
RIGHT ON THE EDGE OF NOWHERE.
我们实际上是
就在无处可寻的边缘。

13:06.551 --> 13:07.689
- WELL, AT LEAST
IT ISN'T RAINING.
- 嗯，至少
没有下雨。

13:07.758 --> 13:09.413
[thunder booming]
[雷霆轰鸣]

13:19.482 --> 13:22.310
- I'M NOT READY
TO GIVE UP JUST YET.
- 我还没准备好
暂时放弃。

13:22.379 --> 13:23.620
- I AM.
- 我是。

13:23.689 --> 13:25.310
- IF WE COULD JUST COME UP
- 如果我们能上来的话

13:25.379 --> 13:27.000
WITH A BETTER WAY
TO REACH THE PEOPLE,
有更好的方法
为了接触人们，

13:27.068 --> 13:28.241
SOMETHING EVERYBODY
CAN SEE AND HEAR.
每个人都有一些东西
可以看到和听到。

13:28.310 --> 13:29.827
- YOU MEAN LIKE A PARADE?
- 你的意思是像游行一样？

13:29.896 --> 13:31.896
- OH, A PARADE!
- 哦，游行！

13:31.965 --> 13:34.275
PATRICK, HOW DID YOU COME UP
WITH SUCH A BRILLIANT IDEA?
帕特里克，你怎么来的
有这么绝妙的主意吗？

13:34.344 --> 13:36.689
- THERE'S ONE GOING BY
RIGHT THERE.
- 有人经过
就在那里。

