14:14.448 --> 14:15.827
- THAT CERTAINLY IS A PARADE.
- 这当然是游行。

14:15.896 --> 14:16.724
- LOOK!
- [gasps]
- 看！
- [喘气]

14:16.793 --> 14:17.931
PLANKTON,
浮游生物，

14:18.000 --> 14:20.068
DRIVING A BIG TRACTOR.
驾驶大型拖拉机。

14:20.137 --> 14:21.551
THIS DOESN'T LOOK GOOD AT ALL,
PATRICK.
这看起来一点都不好，
帕特里克。

14:21.620 --> 14:23.862
- DOES THIS?
[grunting]
- 这是吗？
[咕噜声]

14:23.931 --> 14:26.724
- COME ON.
LET'S GO FOLLOW HIM.
- 快点。
我们去跟随他吧。

