♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

14:32.103 --> 14:34.620
- PEOPLE OF BIKINI BOTTOM.
- 比基尼下装的人。

14:34.689 --> 14:35.793
[crowd murmuring]
[人群窃窃私语]

14:35.862 --> 14:37.172
- DID YOU HEAR THAT?
- 你听到了吗？

14:37.241 --> 14:39.275
- I'M HEARING THE VOICES AGAIN.
- 我又听到那些声音了。

14:39.344 --> 14:40.724
- LOOK!
UP THERE.
- 看！
上面。

14:40.793 --> 14:43.172
- TODAY MARKS A NEW--
- 今天标志着一个新的日子——

14:43.241 --> 14:45.862
[crowd murmuring]
[人群窃窃私语]

14:48.724 --> 14:51.413
- STOP MURMURING!
- 别再抱怨了！

14:51.482 --> 14:53.275
THANK YOU.
谢谢。

14:53.344 --> 14:56.241
AS I WAS SAYING, TODAY MARKS
THE BEGINNING OF A NEW--
正如我所说，今天标志着
新的开始——

14:56.310 --> 14:58.034
all: ♪ FOR ♪
全部：♪ 为了 ♪

14:58.103 --> 15:00.103
♪ HE'S A JOLLY GOOD FELLOW ♪
♪ 他是一个非常好的小伙子 ♪

15:00.172 --> 15:02.551
♪ FOR HE'S A JOLLY GOOD FELLOW ♪
♪ 因为他是一个快乐的好家伙 ♪

15:02.620 --> 15:03.862
♪ FOR HE'S A JOLLY-- ♪
- SHUT UP!
♪ 因为他是个快乐的人—— ♪
- 闭嘴！

15:03.931 --> 15:05.448
- HUH?
WHAT?
- 嗯？
什么？

15:05.517 --> 15:06.586
- TODAY MARKS
A NEW BEGINNING
- 今日标记
新的开始

15:06.655 --> 15:07.793
FOR BIKINI BOTTOM!
比基尼下装！

15:07.862 --> 15:11.103
[cheers and applause]
[欢呼和掌声]

15:11.172 --> 15:15.517
NOW IT'S TIME TO PAVE OUR WAY
DOWN THE ROAD TO SUCCESS.
现在是时候铺路了
迈向成功之路。

15:15.586 --> 15:18.448
[engine rattles]
[发动机嘎嘎声]

15:22.172 --> 15:23.137
[jellyfish humming]
[水母嗡嗡声]

15:28.103 --> 15:30.793
[cheers and applause]
[欢呼和掌声]

15:30.862 --> 15:32.517
[laughs maniacally]
[疯狂地笑]

15:32.586 --> 15:34.241
[inhales deeply]
[深吸一口气]

15:34.310 --> 15:36.931
I LOVE THE SMELL OF HOT TAR
IN THE MORNING.
我喜欢热焦油的味道
早上。

15:37.000 --> 15:38.275
YEAH, BABY!
是的，宝贝！

15:38.344 --> 15:38.965
[chuckles]
[笑声]

15:41.448 --> 15:43.068
HEY, YOU THERE.
嘿，你在那里。

15:43.137 --> 15:45.241
ARE YOU TRYING
TO GET YOURSELF CRUSHED?
你在尝试吗
让自己被压垮？

15:45.310 --> 15:47.655
- I WON'T LET YOU DO IT,
PLANKTON.
- 我不会让你这样做，
浮游生物。

15:47.724 --> 15:50.206
IF YOU'RE GONNA
PAVE OVER JELLYFISH FIELDS,
如果你要
铺平水母田，

15:50.275 --> 15:52.344
YOU'RE GONNA HAVE
TO PAVE OVER ME FIRST.
你将会拥有
首先给我铺路。

16:01.413 --> 16:04.931
- WHOO, YOUR WISH
IS MY COMMAND, SPONGE.
- 哇，你的愿望
这是我的命令，海绵。

16:05.000 --> 16:08.344
[engine roars]
[发动机轰鸣声]

16:08.413 --> 16:11.034
smack!
咂！

16:11.103 --> 16:12.931
- IS THAT ALL YOU GOT?
- 这就是你所得到的一切吗？

16:13.000 --> 16:15.103
[tar hissing]
[焦油嘶嘶声]

16:15.172 --> 16:18.137
[festive marching band music]
【节日军乐队音乐】

16:18.206 --> 16:21.517
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

16:21.586 --> 16:24.000
[jellyfish humming]
[水母嗡嗡声]

16:31.448 --> 16:33.896
[festive horn music]
【喜庆的号角音乐】

16:33.965 --> 16:35.310
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

16:35.379 --> 16:36.344
KNOCK IT OFF, PATRICK.
别闹了，帕特里克。

16:44.448 --> 16:46.241
- I USED TO DREAM
OF ME RESTAURANT
- 我曾经梦想过
我的餐厅

16:46.310 --> 16:48.758
HAVING EASY HIGHWAY ACCESS.
高速公路交通便利。

16:48.827 --> 16:52.000
- YEAH, BUT THIS IS MORE
LIKE HIGHWAY EXCESS.
- 是的，但这更重要
比如高速公路超限。

16:52.068 --> 16:54.448
- WELL, I'M GONNA GO
SOAK MY TENTACLES.
- 好吧，我要走了
浸泡我的触手。

16:54.517 --> 16:56.379
IT'S COLD IN HERE
UNDER ALL THIS CONCRETE.
这里很冷
在这一切混凝土之下。

16:56.448 --> 16:58.137
- BUT, SQUIDWARD,
YOU CAN'T LEAVE.
-但是，章鱼哥，
你不能离开。

16:58.206 --> 17:00.517
WHAT IF WE HAVE A CUSTOMER?
如果我们有客户怎么办？

17:00.586 --> 17:01.724
- REALLY?
- 真的吗？

17:01.793 --> 17:03.482
WE HAVEN'T HAD A CUSTOMER
我们还没有客户

17:03.551 --> 17:05.655
SINCE THE DAY
THIS HIGHWAY WAS BUILT.
从那天起
这条高速公路建成了。

17:05.724 --> 17:07.620
- UH, SQUIDWARD, IT'S
TECHNICALLY A SUPERHIGHWAY.
- 呃，章鱼哥，是这样
从技术上讲是一条高速公路。

17:07.689 --> 17:09.137
- I DON'T CARE WHAT IT IS.
- 我不在乎它是什么。

17:09.206 --> 17:10.620
I'M OUT OF HERE.
我要离开这里了。

17:10.689 --> 17:11.689
- BUT, SQUIDWARD--
- NO.
-但是，章鱼哥--
- 不。

17:11.758 --> 17:12.827
NO, SPONGEBOB.
不，海绵宝宝。

17:12.896 --> 17:14.758
SQUIDWARD'S RIGHT.
章鱼哥是对的。

17:14.827 --> 17:17.068
I THINK IT'S HIGH TIME
WE STARTED ACCEPTING FACTS.
我认为现在是时候了
我们开始接受事实。

17:17.137 --> 17:18.344
[electronic screeching]
[电子尖叫声]

17:18.413 --> 17:19.689
- I'M ON IT, MR. KRABS.
- 我已经开始了，先生。螃蟹。

17:19.758 --> 17:22.137
- NO, BOY-O, NOT THAT KIND.
- 不，男孩，不是那样的。

17:22.206 --> 17:23.896
- MR. KRABS,
WHAT ARE YOU SAYING?
- 先生。螃蟹，
你在说什么？

17:23.965 --> 17:26.586
- THE KRUSTY KRAB
CAN'T STAY IN BUSINESS.
- 脆皮蟹
无法继续经营。

17:26.655 --> 17:28.172
NOT LIKE THIS.
- IT CAN'T?
不是这样的。
- 不能吗？

17:28.241 --> 17:30.103
- NO, SPONGEBOB.
- 不，海绵宝宝。

17:30.172 --> 17:34.310
IT'S TIME TO ACTIVATE
PLAN ZED DASH NINER NINER.
是时候激活了
ZED 冲刺九人计划。

17:34.379 --> 17:37.620
- ZED DASH NINER NINER?
- ZED DASH 九九？

17:37.689 --> 17:40.413
- EUGENE, WHAT IS
PLAN ZED DASH NINER NINER?
- 尤金，什么是
ZED DASH 九九计划？

17:40.482 --> 17:42.655
AND MORE IMPORTANTLY,
HOW DOES IT AFFECT ME?
更重要的是，
它对我有何影响？

17:42.724 --> 17:45.310
- PLAN ZED
DASH NINER NINER IS...
- ZED计划
DASH NINER NINER 是...

17:45.379 --> 17:48.137
[horn honks and engine rumbles]
[喇叭声和发动机隆隆声]

17:48.206 --> 17:50.827
I'M--
[cars zooming, horns honking]
我是——
[汽车疾驰，喇叭鸣响]

17:50.896 --> 17:52.896
I'M--
[cars zooming, horns honking]
我是——
[汽车疾驰，喇叭鸣响]

17:52.965 --> 17:55.275
I'M SELLING THE KRABBY PATTY
SECRET FORMULA TO PLANKTON.
我要卖蟹肉饼
浮游生物的秘密配方。

17:55.344 --> 17:56.793
- EUGENE.
- 尤金。

17:56.862 --> 17:58.482
- I HAVE NO CHOICE.
- 我别无选择。

17:58.551 --> 18:00.137
AND STOP CALLING ME EUGENE.
别再叫我尤金了。

18:00.206 --> 18:02.000
- TELL ME THAT I'M DREAMING.
- 告诉我我在做梦。

18:02.068 --> 18:03.517
[moans]
[呻吟声]

18:03.586 --> 18:05.379
- NOT THIS TIME,
LITTLE FELLA.
- 这次不是，
小家伙。

18:07.724 --> 18:12.551
- [sobbing]
- [抽泣]

18:12.620 --> 18:14.862
- UHH.
LOWER.
- 呃。
降低。

18:14.931 --> 18:16.448
A LITTLE LOWER.
低一点。

18:16.517 --> 18:19.103
YEAH, THAT'S IT.
是的，就是这样。

18:19.172 --> 18:23.206
NOW, WHO COULD THAT BE
DURING MY HOUR OF TRIUMPH?
现在，那会是谁
在我的胜利时刻？

18:23.275 --> 18:25.931
HOW APPROPRIATE.
[snickers]
多么合适啊。
[窃笑]

18:26.000 --> 18:28.379
- PLANKTON,
I'M READY TO NEGOTIATE A PRICE
- 浮游生物，
我已准备好协商价格

18:28.448 --> 18:29.689
FOR ME SECRET FORMULA.
对我来说秘密公式。

18:29.758 --> 18:30.965
- OH, GOODY.
- 哦，太好了。

18:31.034 --> 18:33.344
LET ME JUST WIND MY WATCH.
让我给手表上发条。

18:33.413 --> 18:35.241
- WHAT FOR?
- 做什么的？

18:35.310 --> 18:37.758
- 'CAUSE I'M GONNA LOVE
EVERY MINUTE OF THIS.
- 因为我会爱
这其中的每一分钟。

18:37.827 --> 18:38.965
[faint humming]
[微弱的嗡嗡声]

18:39.034 --> 18:40.137
DID YOU HEAR THAT?
你听到了吗？

18:40.206 --> 18:41.137
KAREN, IS THAT YOU?
凯伦，是你吗？

18:41.206 --> 18:42.172
- UP THERE.
- 上面。

18:42.241 --> 18:43.344
[rumbling]
[隆隆声]

18:43.413 --> 18:45.034
[jellyfish humming]
[水母嗡嗡声]

18:45.103 --> 18:47.620
- WHOA, NELLY.
- 哇哦，内莉。

18:47.689 --> 18:51.206
- FIRST I LOST
JELLYFISH FIELDS.
- 首先我输了
水母区。

18:51.275 --> 18:52.620
AND--
和 -

18:52.689 --> 18:54.724
AND--
和 -

18:54.793 --> 18:55.931
AND--
和 -

18:56.000 --> 18:57.862
- AND WHAT?
- 还有什么？

18:57.931 --> 19:01.206
- AND NOW I'VE LOST
THE ONLY JOB I EVER WANTED.
- 现在我输了
这是我唯一想要的工作。

19:01.275 --> 19:02.620
[sobs]
[抽泣]

19:02.689 --> 19:04.586
- LOOK AT IT THIS WAY.
- 这样看。

19:04.655 --> 19:06.965
I DON'T HAVE TO SEE YOU
EVERY DAY NOW.
我不必见你
现在的每一天。

19:07.034 --> 19:08.275
OH, THIS REALLY
COULD BE THE START
哦，这真的是
可能是一个开始

19:08.344 --> 19:09.620
OF SOMETHING BEAUTIFUL.
美丽的事物。

19:09.689 --> 19:11.448
[zapping]
OW!
[电击]
噢！

19:11.517 --> 19:13.586
WHAT IN THE NAME OF--
- SQUIDWARD, LOOK!
以什么名义——
- 章鱼哥，看！

19:13.655 --> 19:15.689
- WHAT AM I LOOKING--
[screams]
- 我在看什么--
[尖叫声]

19:15.758 --> 19:18.379
- ALL THE JELLYFISH WHO USED
TO LIVE IN JELLYFISH FIELDS
- 所有使用过的水母
生活在水母区

19:18.448 --> 19:20.137
ARE COMING TO BIKINI BOTTOM!
即将推出比基尼泳装！

19:20.206 --> 19:22.103
- YEAH, BUT FOR SOME REASON,
- 是的，但是出于某种原因，

19:22.172 --> 19:24.931
I DON'T THINK IT'S TO DISTRIBUTE
HOLIDAY GIFT BASKETS.
我不认为这是为了分发
节日礼品篮。

19:25.000 --> 19:26.827
- AW, YOU DON'T?
- 哦，你不知道吗？

19:26.896 --> 19:27.965
[jellyfish humming]
[水母嗡嗡声]

19:28.034 --> 19:31.275
[people screaming]
[人们尖叫]

19:33.965 --> 19:36.310
- HEY, YOU KNOW, PLANKTON,
- 嘿，你知道，浮游生物，

19:36.379 --> 19:38.241
LET'S JUST
TALK ABOUT THIS LATER.
让我们来吧
稍后再谈。

19:38.310 --> 19:41.344
I THINK I'M JUST GONNA
RUN FOR ME LIFE.
我想我只是要
为我的生活而奔跑。

19:41.413 --> 19:43.000
- WAIT!
I'M COMING WITH YOU.
- 等待！
我和你一起去。

19:43.068 --> 19:44.586
[chokes]
[窒息]

19:44.655 --> 19:47.206
NO!
不！

19:47.275 --> 19:48.862
[zapping]
NOT THE EYE.
[电击]
不是眼睛。

19:48.931 --> 19:50.275
NOT THE EYE!
[zapping continues]
不是眼睛！
[继续攻击]

19:50.344 --> 19:51.931
[static humming]
[静态嗡嗡声]

19:52.000 --> 19:54.517
- CHAOS RUNS RAMPANT
IN BIKINI BOTTOM.
- 混乱猖獗
比基尼下装。

19:54.586 --> 19:55.862
THAT'S RIGHT, FOLKS.
没错，伙计们。

19:55.931 --> 19:57.758
THIS IS NEWS REPORTER BEN BLENNY
这是新闻记者本·布莱尼

19:57.827 --> 19:59.482
STANDING IN FOR PERCH PERKINS,
WHO'S OUT TODAY
代表PERCH PERKINS，
今天谁出局了

19:59.551 --> 20:01.344
WITH A TERRIBLE CASE
OF INDIGESTION.
一个可怕的案例
消化不良。

20:01.413 --> 20:03.241
AND WE ARE COMING TO YOU LIVE
DURING DAY THREE
我们将为您现场直播
第三天

20:03.310 --> 20:04.448
OF WHAT APPEARS TO BE
BIKINI BOTTOM'S WORST--
看起来是什么
最差的比基尼泳裤——

20:04.517 --> 20:05.689
- AM I ON TELEVISION?
- 我在电视上吗？

20:05.758 --> 20:07.413
- YES, SIR, YOU ARE.
- 是的，先生，你是。

20:07.482 --> 20:08.758
WOULD YOU CARE
TO SAY A FEW WORDS--
你会关心吗
说几句话——

20:08.827 --> 20:10.241
- HI, MOM.
HI, DAD.
- 嗨，妈妈。
嗨，爸爸。

20:10.310 --> 20:11.724
HEY, DR. SLEEN.
HEY, JENNIFER.
嘿，博士。安静。
嘿，詹妮弗。

20:11.793 --> 20:13.310
HEY, SALLY.
HEY, FRANCES.
嘿，莎莉。
嘿，弗朗西斯。

20:13.379 --> 20:14.689
HEY, MABEL.
HEY, JULIE.
嘿，梅布尔。
嘿，朱莉。

20:14.758 --> 20:15.758
HEY, ABIGAIL!
嘿，阿比盖尔！

20:15.827 --> 20:18.448
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

20:18.517 --> 20:20.344
NOW THEY'LL HAVE TO LISTEN.
现在他们必须倾听。

20:20.413 --> 20:22.758
- AND THERE'S MY PALS
IN ALTOONA
- 这是我的朋友们
在阿尔图纳

20:22.827 --> 20:24.758
AND THE GANG
AT THE PUDGY FLIPPER.
和帮派
在矮胖的脚蹼处。

20:24.827 --> 20:25.896
- THANK YOU.
- 谢谢。

20:25.965 --> 20:27.586
HELLO, LITTLE BOY,
你好，小男孩，

20:27.655 --> 20:28.793
HOW ABOUT SAYING A FEW WORDS
INTO THE CAMERA
说几句话怎么样
进入镜头

20:28.862 --> 20:29.793
ABOUT THE CURRENT CRISIS?
关于当前的危机？

20:29.862 --> 20:31.965
- UM, OKAY.
- 嗯，好吧。

20:32.034 --> 20:33.931
SORRY, I'M A LITTLE NERVOUS.
- [screaming]
抱歉，我有点紧张。
- [尖叫]

20:34.000 --> 20:35.793
- THAT'S UNDERSTANDABLE.
JUST TALK NICE AND CLEAR.
- 这是可以理解的。
只要说得好听、清楚就好。

20:35.862 --> 20:37.965
- WELL, OKAY, I GUESS.
- 嗯，好吧，我想。

20:38.034 --> 20:39.655
ALL I HAVE TO SAY
我要说的就是

20:39.724 --> 20:41.448
IS THAT, UM...
是这样吗，嗯……

20:41.517 --> 20:43.931
THAT PROBABLY--
那可能是——

20:44.000 --> 20:47.275
STOP THE MADNESS!
停止疯狂！

20:47.344 --> 20:50.344
WE NEED TO GIVE JELLYFISH FIELDS
BACK TO THE JELLYFISH.
我们需要提供水母栖息地
回到水母。

20:50.413 --> 20:52.310
IF WE RESTORE
THEIR NATURAL HABITAT,
如果我们恢复
他们的自然栖息地，

20:52.379 --> 20:54.517
THEN THEY WILL GO IN PEACE,
然后他们就会平静地离开，

20:54.586 --> 20:57.655
AND BALANCE WILL ONCE AGAIN
BE RESTORED TO OUR LAND.
平衡将再次实现
恢复我们的土地。

20:57.724 --> 20:58.931
SO WHAT DO YOU SAY, EVERYBODY?
那么大家觉得呢？

20:59.000 --> 21:00.068
WILL YOU HELP ME?
你会帮助我吗？

21:00.137 --> 21:01.724
all: NO!
所有人：不！

21:01.793 --> 21:03.241
- YOU'RE KIDDING, RIGHT?
- 你在开玩笑吧？

21:03.310 --> 21:04.896
all: YES!
所有人：是的！

21:04.965 --> 21:06.689
- WELL, ALL RIGHT.
- 好吧，好吧。

21:06.758 --> 21:08.862
EVERYBODY, FOLLOW ME.
大家跟我来。

21:08.931 --> 21:11.379
[all cheering]
[大家欢呼]

21:11.448 --> 21:13.413
OKAY, EVERYONE,
好的，大家，

21:13.482 --> 21:15.896
SAY GOOD-BYE TO THE WORST THING
TO HAPPEN TO THIS TOWN
向最糟糕的事情说再见
这个小镇将会发生什么

21:15.965 --> 21:18.000
SINCE 97¢ STORES.
自 97 美分商店起。

21:18.068 --> 21:20.000
[all cheering]
[大家欢呼]

21:20.068 --> 21:21.758
[metallic squealing]
[金属尖叫声]

21:21.827 --> 21:23.103
[all gasp]
- [snickering]
[全都喘气]
- [窃笑]

21:23.172 --> 21:25.482
GOOD EFFORT, SPONGEDOPE,
尽力而为，海绵宝宝，

21:25.551 --> 21:27.310
BUT YOU CAN'T
TEAR UP MY HIGHWAY.
但你不能
撕毁我的高速公路。

21:27.379 --> 21:29.517
IT'S INDESTRUCTIBLE!
它是坚不可摧的！

21:29.586 --> 21:31.482
- NOT IF WE HAVE ANYTHING
TO DO WITH IT.
- 如果我们有任何东西就不会
处理它。

21:31.551 --> 21:33.344
- LARRY LOBSTER!
- 拉里·龙虾！

21:33.413 --> 21:35.931
- THAT'S RIGHT, PAL,
BUT THAT'S NOT ALL.
- 没错，朋友，
但这还不是全部。

21:36.000 --> 21:39.379
- SANDY SQUIRREL!
- 桑迪松鼠！

21:39.448 --> 21:42.482
MRS. PUFF!
太太。噗！

21:42.551 --> 21:45.413
MERMAID MAN
AND BARNACLE BOY!
美人鱼人
还有藤壶男孩！

21:45.482 --> 21:47.896
PATRICK!
帕特里克！

21:47.965 --> 21:49.206
- SHOOT. SHOOT. SHOOT.
- 射击。射击。射击。

